      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, so I'd give it a six, out of ten. Sitting for long definitely sets it off. Hmm, and there's pain going into the buttock as well, about a month now.",
